{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55266","headline":"再宿友生郊居 · 龚霖","name":"再宿友生郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日走歧路，唯君守草堂。\n重来身若旧，相见话偏长。\n夜半四邻静，雨余羣本香。\n不能同此住，名利自茫茫。\n（同前第五册第三一五八页。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"龚霖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}